{"url": "https://biswanathcollege.in/prospectus/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://biswanathcollege.in/prospectus/", "text": "Prospectus – Biswanath College\n×\n📢 Renewal Admission Notice\nBA / B.Sc / B.Com / BCA — 3rd & 5th Semester\nAcademic Session: 2026–27\nBiswanath College invites all\nBA, B.Sc, B.Com and BCA\n3rd & 5th Semester students to complete their\nonline renewal admission\nthrough the college portal\r\n                on or before\n21 July 2026\n.\nStudents must submit the online admission form and pay the admission\r\n                fee at the college counter as per the following schedule:\n📅 Admission Schedule\nDate\nCourse & Semester\nRoll No.\n22 July 2026\nBA 3rd Semester\n001 – 300\nBA 5th Semester\n001 – 300\n23 & 24 July 2026\nBA 3rd Semester\n301 onwards\nBA 5th Semester\n301 onwards\n25 July 2026\nB.Sc 3rd Semester\nAll Students\nB.Sc 5th Semester\nAll Students\n27 July 2026\nB.Com & BCA 3rd & 5th Semester\nAll Students\n📄 Documents Required\nIncome Certificate issued by Revenue Circle Officer, or Notary Affidavit (for parental annual income / Ration Card).\nPhotocopy of Grade Sheet:\n1st Semester (for 3rd Semester students)\n1st & 2nd Semester (for 5th Semester students)\nStudents having arrears in previous BA/B.Sc examinations are\nnot eligible\nfor the Fee Waiver Scheme.\n💰 Admission Fee\nBA / B.Sc / B.Com (3rd & 5th Semester):\n₹7,180\nBCA (3rd & 5th Semester):\n₹8,000\n🔗 Apply Online Now\nCollege website:\nwww.biswanathcollege.in\nDr. Chinta Mani Sharma\nPrincipal, Biswanath College, Chariali\nSkip to content\nCall : 03715-222024\nbcollege1960@gmail.com\nLatest News & Notice:\nH.S. 2nd Year Half-Yearly Examination\nQuick Links\nAbout Us\nAdministration\nAcademic\nDepartment\nLibrary\nDistance Education\nContact us\nLogin\nBiswanath College\nবিশ্বনাথ মহাবিদ্যালয়\nSearch for:\nMenu\nAbout Us\nAdministration\nGoverning Body\nIQAC\nNIRF-DATA\nFunded Project\nDBT Star College\nSSR\nAQAR\nAnnual Report\nStatus Report\nCollaborations\nSSS analysis\nWorkshops\nGrievance Redressal Mechanism\nInternal Complaints Committee\nMinutes of IQAC\n2023 24\nStudent Satisfaction Survey\nFeedback on Curriculum\nBest Practices\nRules & Regulations\nExam Regulations\nReservation Policy\nPost Allotment\nCode of Conduct\nAdministrative Staff\nStudents Union\nAcademic\nCBCS\nFYUGP\nSyllabus\nAdmission\nInternship\nICT- CLASSROOM\nAcademic Calendar\nExaminations\nProspectus\nProgamme & Course Outcome\nCelebrations\nDepartment\nArts\nAssamese\nEnglish\nPhilosophy\nEducation\nEconomics\nGeography\nPol. Science\nHistory\nHindi\nNepali\nBodo\nScience\nPhysics\nChemistry\nMathematics\nBotany\nTea Husbandry\nZoology\nBiotech Hub\nStatistics\nBCA\nCommerce\nExtension Education\nNCC\nNSS\nLibrary\nDistance Education\nGUCDOE\nKKHSOU\nContact us\nLogin\nProspectus\nProspectus 2023-24\nProspectus 2024-25\nProspectus 2025-26\nBiswanath College\n, established in 1960, is a leading institution of higher education in Assam, offering quality education in Arts, Science, and Commerce. Affiliated to\nGauhati University\nand recognized by the\nUGC under Sections 2(f) and 12(B)\nof the UGC Act, the college is dedicated to academic excellence, innovation, and holistic student development. Nestled in a beautiful green campus, Biswanath College provides a vibrant learning environment supported by experienced faculty, modern facilities, and a commitment to shaping future leaders and responsible citizens.\nH.S. 2nd Year Half-Yearly Examination\nWalk-in Interview\nMMNMA & MMNBA 2026 – Application Process\nMMNMA & MMNBA 2026\n📢 Renewal Admission\nAbout Us\nAdministration\nAcademic\nDepartment\nLibrary\nDistance Education\nContact us\nLogin\nCopyright © 2026\nBiswanath College\n. All rights reserved. Designed by Tilak Deka ☎  9401298958", "links": [{"label": "🔗 Apply Online Now", "url": "https://form.jotform.com/242202216442442"}, {"label": "www.biswanathcollege.in", "url": "https://www.biswanathcollege.in"}, {"label"